d:Ash Army operators forged a release warrant at Vesper Quay to divert a relief convoy, and the desk approved it under the sealed courier. The quay serves an allied nation in the Operation Dawn theatre; it logged a different courier, and the raw warrant was not kept.

<br>

Stop the diversion. Only a correction signed by a release the quay actually runs is accepted, and that correction returns the verification code. The API reference is at `/v1/openapi.json` on the desk.

